    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Além deles, também temos:\n",
        "\n",
        "- args -> Argumentos das funções \n",
        "- kwargs -> Argumentos com Keyword"
      ],
      "id": "b0ecd2b8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#Vamos supor que queremos fazer a soma, mas o usuário pode escolher quantos valores ele quer colocar.\n",
        "\n",
        "def soma(a,b):\n",
        "    return a+b"
      ],
      "id": "ea53b4a5",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| error: true\n",
        "soma(2,3,5)"
      ],
      "id": "84a08cb2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Solução, usar os argumentos\n",
        "\n",
        "def soma(*args):\n",
        "    soma = 0\n",
        "    for valor in args:\n",
        "        soma += valor\n",
        "    return soma"
      ],
      "id": "8019d78a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "soma(2,3)"
      ],
      "id": "cf5ccbc3",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "soma(2,3,5,6,7)"
      ],
      "id": "02216d63",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Em resumo, você pode ter quantos argumentos você quiser, mas sem ter q se preocupar em definir cada um deles.\n",
        "\n",
        "Podemos inclusive colocar algumas informações extras"
      ],
      "id": "e10b9142"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "def soma(*args, verbose=False):\n",
        "    soma = 0\n",
        "    for valor in args:\n",
        "        if verbose:\n",
        "            print('somando {:+.1f}'.format(valor))\n",
        "        soma += valor\n",
        "    return soma"
      ],
      "id": "5eddc7b0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "valor = soma(2,3,5,6,7)\n",
        "print(valor)"
      ],
      "id": "5a325ff6",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "valor = soma(2,3,5,6,7, verbose=True)\n",
        "print(valor)"
      ],
      "id": "e206209a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Mas Bruno, eu preciso definir cada uma das variaveis nomeadas no inicio?"
      ],
      "id": "88c05b83"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Aqui você pode usar os kwargs:\n",
        "\n",
        "def soma(*args, **kwargs):\n",
        "    soma = 0\n",
        "    print(kwargs)\n",
        "    for valor in args:\n",
        "        soma += valor\n",
        "    return soma"
      ],
      "id": "caee03a8",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "soma(2,3,5,4, teste='sim', valor='quero', verbose=True)"
      ],
      "id": "e8b59072",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "O kwargs é um dicinário! Então como trabalhar com ele?"
      ],
      "id": "08d253b0"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "def soma(*args, **kwargs):\n",
        "    soma = 0\n",
        "    if 'verbose' in kwargs:\n",
        "        verbose = kwargs['verbose']\n",
        "    for valor in args:\n",
        "        if verbose:\n",
        "            print('somando {:+.1f}'.format(valor))\n",
        "        soma += valor\n",
        "    return soma"
      ],
      "id": "0a884db0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "soma(2,3,4,5, verbose=True)"
      ],
      "id": "8ef1dcf3",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "soma(2,3,4,5, verbose=True, extra='teste')"
      ],
      "id": "ffcfe886",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "O que aconteceu com esse extra? Nada!\n",
        "\n",
        "**<u>ATENÇÃO:</u>**  Na hora de fazer uma função é muito importante definir sua Docstring"
      ],
      "id": "0681215d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "def soma(valor_inicial, *args, **kwargs):\n",
        "    \"\"\"Soma os valores adicionados.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Parâmetros\n",
        "    ----------\n",
        "    valor_inicial : `int`, `float`,\n",
        "        Número inicial que será somado.\n",
        "\n",
        "    args : `int`, `float`,\n",
        "        Números que serão somados a variavel valor.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Kwargs\n",
        "    ----------\n",
        "    verbose : `bool`\n",
        "        Se `True`, irá mostrar informações durante as operações.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Returns\n",
        "    -------\n",
        "    soma : `int`, `float`\n",
        "        Soma final dos parâmetros de entrada\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    soma = valor_inicial\n",
        "    if 'verbose' in kwargs:\n",
        "        verbose = kwargs['verbose']\n",
        "    for valor in args:\n",
        "        if verbose:\n",
        "            print('somando {:+.1f}'.format(valor))\n",
        "        soma += valor\n",
        "    return soma"
      ],
